{"status": "supplement", "name": "矩阵幂", "card": {"name": "矩阵幂", "concept": "矩阵幂 A^k 表示同一个矩阵连乘 k 次，用于离散递推、Markov 链、线性系统和矩阵函数。", "formulas": ["A^0=I,\\quad A^{k+1}=A^kA", "A^k=(P\\Lambda P^{-1})^k=P\\Lambda^kP^{-1}\\quad \\text{（可对角化时）}", "\\Lambda^k=\\operatorname{diag}(\\lambda_1^k,\\dots,\\lambda_n^k)"], "example": "若 A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\0&3\\end{pmatrix}，则 A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&0\\\\0&3^k\\end{pmatrix}。", "pitfall": "一般 (AB)^k\\neq A^kB^k，除非 A,B 可交换；也不能对矩阵元素逐个求 k 次幂（对角阵除外）。", "prereq": ["矩阵乘法", "对角化/特征分解"], "source": "AI 补充 · 未经老师确认", "verified": false}, "suggests": [{"name": "邻接矩阵（Adjacency Matrix）", "course": "数据结构与算法分析", "doc_id": "graph_bfs", "score": 0.4}]}